@startuml
' umLoud template — activity diagram
title <Process name>
|Role A|
start
:First Action;
fork
  :Parallel Action 1;
fork again
  |Role B|
  :Parallel Action 2;
end fork
|Role A|
if (condition?) then ([yes])
  :Action If Yes;
else ([else])
  :Action Otherwise;
endif
:Final Action;
stop
@enduml
